# ─── Digital Extremes' game data is NOT redistributed here ───────────────
# It is downloaded and rebuilt on demand by tools/build_data.py — locally for
# you, and in CI for the published site. Keeping it out means this repo stays
# source-only and every build pulls fresh data straight from DE.
data/prime-data.js
data/prime-data.json
# the fissure list on its own, so an open page can re-read the one part of the
# payload that expires without downloading the other 1.9 MB
data/fissures.json

# item artwork pulled by --with-images. Same reasoning: it is DE's artwork,
# served via cdn.warframestat.us, and not ours to redistribute.
assets/img/

# Availability changelog — written by the build from .cache/state.json, so it
# is local history of *your* builds rather than a shared record.
CHANGELOG.md

# HTTP cache and freshness state — regenerated by tools/build_data.py
.cache/

# single-file build output
dist/

# design drafts, not part of the shipped site
drafts/

# python
# Local mockups. temp_mockup.html is the scratchpad for showing a proposed
# change against real data before building it — see PROJECT.md section 2. It is
# never uploaded, and nothing in the site or the tests reads it.
temp_mockup.html

# Optional test-only dependencies. package.json and its lock file are tracked
# so anyone who wants the browser tests gets the same Playwright; the packages
# themselves are not, and nothing the site ships needs them.
node_modules/

# Playwright's scratch directory. Created by every browser-test run and left
# empty when they all pass, so it is noise in `git status` rather than a result.
test-results/

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# editor / tool config — local to whoever is working on it
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Cold-start notes for an AI assistant. Local on purpose: it is a map of the
# four tracked documents rather than a fifth one, so it has no reader who is not
# already looking at this folder, and nothing in the suite checks it. Keeping it
# untracked means it can go stale without becoming the kind of published, trusted,
# wrong document PROJECT.md §2 warns about.
CLAUDE.md

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
